[
  {
    "speaker": "P5124",
    "start": 2.9409999999998035,
    "end": 5.143000000000029,
    "text": "at each other. OK. Turn left at the corner."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5125",
    "start": 6.643999999999778,
    "end": 12.067000000000007,
    "text": "you sure? Let's play outside in the sun."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5124",
    "start": 7.403999999999996,
    "end": 7.585000000000036,
    "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5124",
    "start": 13.327000000000226,
    "end": 17.610000000000127,
    "text": "I love the sun. I'm a big time sun fan. So I really don't mind."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5124",
    "start": 24.635999999999967,
    "end": 26.05699999999979,
    "text": "The picture is hanging askew."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5125",
    "start": 27.177000000000135,
    "end": 34.09900000000016,
    "text": "We'll straighten it. The books are aligned on the shelf."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5124",
    "start": 34.884000000000015,
    "end": 36.304999999999836,
    "text": "Perfect, as they should be."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5124",
    "start": 44.64800000000014,
    "end": 51.83100000000013,
    "text": "The statue is gigantic. You gotta love it."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5125",
    "start": 47.6840000000002,
    "end": 49.24400000000014,
    "text": "Statues usually are, I think."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5125",
    "start": 55.085999999999785,
    "end": 56.547000000000025,
    "text": "The mountain is huge."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5124",
    "start": 57.733999999999924,
    "end": 60.91600000000017,
    "text": "I love climbing mountains. I'm a mountain man."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5124",
    "start": 66.29799999999977,
    "end": 73.52199999999993,
    "text": "All the cookies are gone. Don't be too well."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5125",
    "start": 68.4670000000001,
    "end": 69.20699999999988,
    "text": "Did you eat them all?"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5125",
    "start": 76.07099999999991,
    "end": 77.5920000000001,
    "text": "There are many stars in the sky."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5124",
    "start": 78.16199999999981,
    "end": 80.58300000000008,
    "text": "I love stargazing, actually."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5124",
    "start": 87.42599999999993,
    "end": 88.58599999999979,
    "text": "I bought five books."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5125",
    "start": 89.53800000000001,
    "end": 90.83899999999994,
    "text": "Five? Are you going to read all of them?"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5125",
    "start": 96.68199999999979,
    "end": 97.74299999999994,
    "text": "We need four chairs."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5124",
    "start": 99.01000000000022,
    "end": 100.0909999999999,
    "text": "Four chairs, I'll remember that."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5124",
    "start": 107.72400000000016,
    "end": 108.80499999999984,
    "text": "The candy is sweet."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5125",
    "start": 110.09000000000015,
    "end": 118.63400000000001,
    "text": "I hope so, unless it's like sour sweet. The chips are salty."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5124",
    "start": 119.89100000000008,
    "end": 123.8130000000001,
    "text": "Yeah, sometimes they can be over salty."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5124",
    "start": 134.11900000000014,
    "end": 135.8800000000001,
    "text": "The car is actually nearer than the bus."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5125",
    "start": 138.10199999999986,
    "end": 139.26299999999992,
    "text": "Well, then we don't have to walk as far."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5125",
    "start": 145.95200000000023,
    "end": 150.55600000000004,
    "text": "The star is the farthest away. I don't know."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5124",
    "start": 148.5920000000001,
    "end": 149.17200000000003,
    "text": "Which one is that?"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5124",
    "start": 158.07600000000002,
    "end": 158.97699999999986,
    "text": "He is cooking dinner."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5125",
    "start": 160.82600000000002,
    "end": 161.48599999999988,
    "text": "Is he a good cook?"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5125",
    "start": 166.49099999999999,
    "end": 167.5920000000001,
    "text": "He's pointing at the map."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5124",
    "start": 168.88200000000006,
    "end": 169.5619999999999,
    "text": "Pay attention to that."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5125",
    "start": 170.61499999999978,
    "end": 170.7750000000001,
    "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5124",
    "start": 180.97800000000007,
    "end": 182.13799999999992,
    "text": "She's swimming in the pool."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5125",
    "start": 184.08300000000008,
    "end": 192.10399999999981,
    "text": "Well, it could be a pond, could be a pool, could be a... She's waving goodbye."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5124",
    "start": 187.51999999999998,
    "end": 188.05999999999995,
    "text": "Body of water."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5124",
    "start": 193.1210000000001,
    "end": 193.78099999999995,
    "text": "Tell her I said bye."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5124",
    "start": 202.04199999999992,
    "end": 203.8829999999998,
    "text": "He is performing on theater stage."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5125",
    "start": 205.52700000000004,
    "end": 206.10699999999997,
    "text": "That's big."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5125",
    "start": 211.6880000000001,
    "end": 213.0880000000002,
    "text": "He is speaking with authority."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P5124",
    "start": 214.45699999999988,
    "end": 216,
    "text": "Every man should. How are"
  }
]